title: Military Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: military_policy_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and national_defence_minister_party = "KCP" and military_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/kcp_military.png
#subtitle: Dealing with the military.

= Military Policy

The Kadjan military is a small disorganized force with little strength. It is weakened by the existence of province military and paramilitary forces trying to change that fact would provoke civil war.

- @increase_funding: We must increase funding to our military.
- @decrease_funding: Reduce funding to the military.
- @reform: Reform the military to be loyal to us..
- @root: No change to military policy.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@increase_funding
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have the budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; reichswehr_loyalty += 0.07 if reichswehr_loyalty < 1; reichswehr_strength += 20; socialist_dissent += 5; west_relation += 1; east_relation += 1; austria_relation +=1; reparations_negotiation += 1; eu_progress += 1; economic_growth += 0.1

With a stronger military we are more dominant on the geopolitical field as our words now carry more weight and increases our power in any would be civil war.

@decrease_funding
subtitle: +1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: There is nothing left to cut.
choose-if: reichswehr_strength > 0
on-arrival: budget += 1; up_relation -= 8; reichswehr_militancy -= 1; reichswehr_strength -= 20; sh_strength += 15; sa_strength += 5; sh_militancy += 0.05;

The military has fewer guns and fewer soldiers we seem powerless in geopolitics and should a civil war come we would be in a world of a pain. Plus the now unemployed soilders soon find home in the oppositions militias.

@reform
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1 and reichswehr_loyalty < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget < 1 : We do not have the budget. ?]
on-arrival:  reichswehr_loyalty += 0.15; kcp_tyrrany += 1

We have removed officers and soilders from the military not loyal to the goverment. Our opposition call it building a dictatorship around the party.
